         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP1019_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>māh Ardwahišt abar sāl 96 rōz Zāmy[ād  ... ...
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>nām-ēw  Abzūd-Xusrō  pus  ī  az  *Asp-gurd deh pad dar-espās[
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>pad *Halīg pēš kē xwēškārīhā guft kū Dābōy nām-ēw [ ... ... ... ī]
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ān  *Asp-gurd deh pad ēn kū andar xwēšīh ī Dābōy [ 
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>warzāg  ēw-tāg  ān  wahāg  arzist  s(atēr)  15 [ud (w)ēš tis] be ō man dād tō ... ī ān
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>pand rāy ǰār-ēw tā ān xwāstag dād pad bun ī ān *Asp-gurd deh r[āy]
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>xwēš  zamīg  ī  kišwzār  2  kardag  kē  zayt  ī wēhmān pad nēmrō[z] hamāg ī
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>āwarēd be ō Dābōy dād ... ... Dābōy ... nūn
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>az  sāxt  ī  ān  zamīg  kam  ... ... ... ud  wahāg ... ...ī 
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>abāz ō Dābōy ēw dād ud ... ... ... ... zamīg
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>ī kišwzār ayārd ī ō xwāstagdārān /// ī Dābōy [ud] nūn Dābōy
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>dārēd man /// ī xwēš rāy ... ... ... ... ... rāy
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>man hamēmāl man ast ān harw pad wahāg ////////// 
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>]kard  ud  wahāg  ī  ān  harw rāy  zamīg  ō  [ ]Dāb
               <lb n="15" xml:id="trc-p1-l15"/>nē dād ud ān-iz zamīg ī //////// man pad-iš padirāy [       ] ... ...
               <lb n="16" xml:id="trc-p1-l16"/>Dābōy abām ast bē ... ... ... ... ... ō ... ...
               <lb n="17" xml:id="trc-p1-l17"/>sāxt bē agar Dābōy ... ... ... ... ... ... ... Dābōy
               <lb n="18" xml:id="trc-p1-l18"/>... ... ... paydāgīh ... ... ... rōz Zāmyād[ 
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trc-p1-l19"/>ī ham-sāl 96 ... ... ... pēš Zurwāndādweh
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trc-p1-l20"/>āyēm agar tis-iz ǰuttar kunēm ... ... ... ... ... ud ān ǰādag
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trc-p1-l21"/>arz s(atēr) 5 sūd ō Dābōy dahēm ... ... ... ... ... dādestān
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trc-p1-l22"/>ēstēd   ... ... ... ...  pad  āsūd   ... ... ... ... ...ī  az Aspgurd
               <lb n="23" xml:id="trc-p1-l23"/>                 ] ... padistā āwišt ud ēwarīh rāy axw xwadāy muhr
               <lb n="24" xml:id="trc-p1-l24"/>                      abar nihād
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP1019_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>[This month Ard]wahišt (2nd month) in the year 96 day Zāmy[ād (28th day)
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>one [... ...] by name, son of Abzūd-Xusrō, from the village of *Asp-gurd before the service of the residence
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>at *Halīg before whom he dutifully spoke: One Dābōy by name [... ... ... from]
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>the community of *Asp-gurd on behalf of this (case): Under the possessions of Dābōy
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>(of) a single tillage by one ploughing ox the value of which is estimated at 15 States [and a little bit more] will give to me ...
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>on behalf of the counsel all at once so that that money is to give to the bun of the village of *Asp-gurd
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>2 sections of his own land of field which produces olives of large (trees) as desired
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>to be given to Dābōy ... now
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>from the *produce of the land little
               <lb n="10-18" xml:id="trans-p1-l10-18"/>too fragmentary ... ... ... day Zāmyād
               <lb n="19" xml:id="trans-p1-l19"/>[of month Ardwahišt] in the year ... ... ... before Zurwāndādweh
               <lb n="20" xml:id="trans-p1-l20"/>I will come.
               <lb n="21" xml:id="trans-p1-l21"/>...
               <lb n="22" xml:id="trans-p1-l22"/>...
               <lb n="23-24" xml:id="trans-p1-l23-24"/>] .... he sealed the promise and (for making it) legally binding the Lord put the seal over it.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
